#: title
msgid "Fedora IoT Community"
msgstr "Fedora IoT Gemenskap"

#: description
msgctxt "description"
msgid "Join a community of users and contributors focused on Fedora IoT"
msgstr ""
"Gå med i en gemenskap av användare och bidragsgivare fokuserade på Fedora IoT"

#: header-%3Esubtitle
msgctxt "header->subtitle"
msgid "Join a community of users and contributors focused on Fedora IoT"
msgstr ""
"Gå med i en gemenskap av användare och bidragsgivare fokuserade på Fedora IoT"

#: header-%3Etitle
msgid "Community"
msgstr "Gemenskap"

#: header-%3Edetails-%3E[0]-%3Edetail
msgid ""
"Fedora IoT is created by a team in the Fedora Project Community called the "
"IoT Working Group."
msgstr ""
"Fedora IoT skapas av ett team i Fedora Projekt-gemenskapen som kallas IoT "
"Working Group."

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Eheader-%3EsectionTitle
msgid "Communication Channels"
msgstr "Kommunikationskanaler"

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Ecard-%3E[0]-%3Etitle
msgid "Forum"
msgstr "Forum"

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Ecard-%3E[0]-%3Esubtitle
msgid ""
"The Fedora IoT tag on Fedora's Discourse-based discussion forum is a great "
"place to connect with other Fedora Workstation users and contributors."
msgstr ""
"Fedora IoT-taggen på Fedoras Discourse baserade diskussionsforum är ett bra "
"ställe att få kontakt med andra Fedora IoT-användare och bidragsgivare."

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Ecard-%3E[0]-%3Ecta-%3Etext
msgctxt "section->[0]->content->card->[0]->cta->text"
msgid "Visit Now"
msgstr "Besök nu"

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Ecard-%3E[1]-%3Etitle
msgid "Chat"
msgstr "Chatt"

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Ecard-%3E[1]-%3Esubtitle
msgid ""
"You can chat with the Fedora IoT Working Group via either Matrix or IRC: "
"#iot:fedoraproject.org on Matrix and #fedora-iot on irc.libera.chat."
msgstr ""
"Du kan chatta med Fedora IoT Working Group via antingen Matrix eller IRC: "
"#iot:fedoraproject.org på Matrix och #fedora-iot på irc.libera.chat."

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Ecard-%3E[1]-%3Ecta-%3Etext
msgid "Chat Now"
msgstr "Chatta nu"

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Ecard-%3E[2]-%3Etitle
msgid "Mailing List"
msgstr "E-postlista"

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Ecard-%3E[2]-%3Esubtitle
msgid ""
"The Fedora IoT Working Group sends meeting agendas and minutes and has "
"discussions on their mailing list at iot@lists.fedoraproject.org."
msgstr ""
"Fedora IoT-arbetsgruppen skickar mötesagendor och protokoll och har "
"diskussioner på sin e-postlista på iot@lists.fedoraproject.org."

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Ecard-%3E[2]-%3Ecta-%3Etext
msgctxt "section->[0]->content->card->[2]->cta->text"
msgid "Visit Now"
msgstr "Besök nu"

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Etext
msgid ""
"Your friendly and helpful contributions to these communication channels "
"would be greatly appreciated!"
msgstr ""
"Dina vänliga och hjälpsamma bidrag till dessa kommunikationskanaler skulle "
"vara mycket uppskattade!"
